# Record of LG originals we have already seen, per bundled plugin variant. This is
# NOT the gate anymore - the plugin is chosen by GStreamer version (variants.tab).
# It only lets ctl.sh skip the isolated re-check for an already-seen original, and
# documents which exact models/firmware a variant was confirmed against. A new
# original on a known GStreamer version is fine; it is load-checked once and added.
# columns: <original-md5>  <variant (gst version)>  <label>
